Problem97.ATailFrontierLiveClosure.B1CardSixRawOrderIngress.orderedRoleEmbedding_orderedRoleIndex
  {D : CounterexampleData} {S : SurplusCapPacket D.A} {radius : ℝ} {H : CriticalShellSystem D.A}
